{"suttaId":"sn1.34","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[408,437],"vripara":"34"},"segments":{"sn1.34:0.3":"Nasantisuttaṃ","sn1.34:1.1":"Ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṃ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme.","sn1.34:1.2":"Atha kho sambahulā satullapakāyikā devatāyo abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkantavaṇṇā kevalakappaṃ jetavanaṃ obhāsetvā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṃsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhaṃsu.","sn1.34:1.3":"Ekamantaṃ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi –","sn1.34:2.1":"“Na santi kāmā manujesu niccā,","sn1.34:2.2":"Santīdha kamanīyāni yesu [kāmesu (ka.)] baddho;","sn1.34:2.3":"Yesu pamatto apunāgamanaṃ,","sn1.34:2.4":"Anāgantā puriso maccudheyyā”ti.","sn1.34:3.1":"“Chandajaṃ aghaṃ chandajaṃ dukkhaṃ;","sn1.34:3.2":"Chandavinayā aghavinayo;","sn1.34:3.3":"Aghavinayā dukkhavinayo”ti.","sn1.34:4.1":"“Na te kāmā yāni citrāni loke,","sn1.34:4.2":"Saṅkapparāgo purisassa kāmo;","sn1.34:4.3":"Tiṭṭhanti citrāni tatheva loke,","sn1.34:4.4":"Athettha dhīrā vinayanti chandaṃ.","sn1.34:5.1":"“Kodhaṃ jahe vippajaheyya mānaṃ,","sn1.34:5.2":"Saṃyojanaṃ sabbamatikkameyya;","sn1.34:5.3":"Taṃ nāmarūpasmimasajjamānaṃ,","sn1.34:5.4":"Akiñcanaṃ nānupatanti dukkhā.","sn1.34:6.1":"“Pahāsi saṅkhaṃ na vimānamajjhagā [na ca mānamajjhagā (ka. sī.), na vimānamāgā (syā. kaṃ.)],","sn1.34:6.2":"Acchecchi taṇhaṃ idha nāmarūpe;","sn1.34:6.3":"Taṃ chinnaganthaṃ anighaṃ nirāsaṃ,","sn1.34:6.4":"Pariyesamānā nājjhagamuṃ;","sn1.34:6.5":"Devā manussā idha vā huraṃ vā,","sn1.34:6.6":"Saggesu vā sabbanivesanesū”ti.","sn1.34:7.1":"“Taṃ ce hi nāddakkhuṃ tathāvimuttaṃ","sn1.34:7.2":"(iccāyasmā mogharājā),","sn1.34:7.3":"Devā manussā idha vā huraṃ vā;","sn1.34:7.4":"Naruttamaṃ atthacaraṃ narānaṃ,","sn1.34:7.5":"Ye taṃ namassanti pasaṃsiyā te”ti.","sn1.34:8.1":"“Pasaṃsiyā tepi bhavanti bhikkhū","sn1.34:8.2":"(mogharājāti bhagavā),","sn1.34:8.3":"Ye taṃ namassanti tathāvimuttaṃ;","sn1.34:8.4":"Aññāya dhammaṃ vicikicchaṃ pahāya,","sn1.34:8.5":"Saṅgātigā tepi bhavanti bhikkhū”ti. 5."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":316,"to":329,"paras":[{"para":316,"vripara":"34","refs":["sn1.34:2","sn1.34:3","sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Catutthe <b>kamanīyānī</b>ti rūpādīni iṭṭhārammaṇāni.","<b>Apunāgamanaṃ anāgantā puriso maccudheyyā</b>ti tebhūmakavaṭṭasaṅkhātā maccudheyyā apunāgamanasaṅkhātaṃ nibbānaṃ anāgantā.","Nibbānañhi sattā na punāgacchanti, tasmā taṃ apunāgamananti vuccati.","Taṃ kāmesu baddho ca pamatto ca anāgantā nāma hoti, so taṃ pāpuṇituṃ na sakkoti, tasmā evamāha.","<b>Chandaja</b>nti taṇhāchandato jātaṃ.","<b>Agha</b>nti pañcakkhandhadukkhaṃ.","Dutiyapadaṃ tasseva vevacanaṃ.","<b>Chandavinayā aghavinayo</b>ti taṇhāvinayena pañcakkhandhavinayo.","<b>Aghavinayā dukkhavinayo</b>ti pañcakkhandhavinayena vaṭṭadukkhaṃ vinītameva hoti.","<b>Citrānī</b>ti ārammaṇacittāni.","<b>Saṅkapparāgo</b>ti saṅkappitarāgo.","Evamettha vatthukāmaṃ paṭikkhipitvā kilesakāmo kāmoti vutto.","Ayaṃ panattho <b>pasūrasuttena</b> (su. ni. 830 ādayo) vibhāvetabbo.","Pasūraparibbājako hi therena “saṅkapparāgo purisassa kāmo”ti vutte –"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":317,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["“Na te kāmā yāni citrāni loke,"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":318,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Saṅkapparāgañca vadesi kāmaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":319,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Saṅkappayaṃ akusale vitakke,"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":320,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Bhikkhūpi te hehinti kāmabhogī”ti. –"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":321,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Āha.","Atha naṃ thero avoca –"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":322,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["“Te ce kāmā yāni citrāni loke,"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":323,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Saṅkapparāgaṃ na vadesi kāmaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":324,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Passanto rūpāni manoramāni,"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":325,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Satthāpi te hehiti kāmabhogī."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":326,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Suṇanto saddāni, ghāyanto gandhāni;"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":327,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Sāyanto rasāni, phusanto phassāni manoramāni;"],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":328,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["Satthāpi te hehiti kāmabhogī”ti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":329,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4","sn1.34:5","sn1.34:6","sn1.34:7","sn1.34:8"],"lines":["<b>Athettha dhīrā</b>ti atha etesu ārammaṇesu paṇḍitā chandarāgaṃ vinayanti.","<b>Saṃyojanaṃ sabba</b>nti dasavidhampi saṃyojanaṃ.","<b>Akiñcana</b>nti rāgakiñcanādivirahitaṃ.","<b>Nānupatanti dukkhā</b>ti vaṭṭadukkhā pana tassa upari na patanti.","<b>Iccāyasmā</b> <b>mogharājā</b>ti, “pahāsi saṅkha”nti gāthaṃ sutvā tassaṃ parisati anusandhikusalo mogharājā nāma thero “imissā gāthāya attho na yathānusandhiṃ gato”ti cintetvā yathānusandhiṃ ghaṭento evamāha.","Tattha <b>idha vā huraṃ vā</b>ti idhaloke vā paraloke vā.","<b>Naruttamaṃ atthacaraṃ narāna</b>nti kiñcāpi sabbe khīṇāsavā naruttamā ceva atthacarā ca narānaṃ, thero pana dasabalaṃ sandhāyevamāha.","<b>Ye taṃ namassanti pasaṃsiyā te</b>ti yadi tathāvimuttaṃ devamanussā namassanti, atha ye taṃ bhagavantaṃ kāyena vā vācāya vā anupaṭipattiyā vā namassanti, te kiṃ pasaṃsiyā, udāhu apasaṃsiyāti.","<b>Bhikkhūti</b> mogharājattheraṃ ālapati.","<b>Aññāya dhamma</b>nti catusaccadhammaṃ jānitvā.","<b>Saṅgātigā tepi bhavantī</b>ti ye taṃ kāyena vā vācāya vā anupaṭipattiyā vā namassanti.","Te catusaccadhammaṃ aññāya vicikicchaṃ pahāya saṅgātigāpi honti, pasaṃsiyāpi hontīti.","Catutthaṃ. 5."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:5"],["sn1.34:5"],["sn1.34:5"],["sn1.34:5"],["sn1.34:6"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:8"],["sn1.34:8"],["sn1.34:8"],["sn1.34:8"],["sn1.34:8"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.34:2.2","kamanīyānī",0,0],["sn1.34:3.1","chandajaṃ",0,4],["sn1.34:3.1","aghaṃ",0,5],["sn1.34:3.2","aghaṃ",0,5],["sn1.34:3.3","aghaṃ",0,5],["sn1.34:3.2","chandavinayā aghavinayo",0,7],["sn1.34:3.3","aghavinayā dukkhavinayo",0,8],["sn1.34:4.1","citrānī",0,9],["sn1.34:4.3","citrānī",0,9],["sn1.34:4.2","saṅkapparāgo",0,10],["sn1.34:4.4","athettha dhīrā",13,0],["sn1.34:5.2","saṃyojanaṃ sabbaṃ",13,1],["sn1.34:5.4","akiñcanaṃ",13,2],["sn1.34:5.4","nānupatanti dukkhā",13,3],["sn1.34:6.5","idha vā huraṃ vā",13,5],["sn1.34:7.4","naruttamaṃ atthacaraṃ narānaṃ",13,6],["sn1.34:7.5","ye taṃ namassanti pasaṃsiyā te",13,7],["sn1.34:8.5","bhikkhūti",13,8],["sn1.34:8.4","aññāya dhammaṃ",13,9],["sn1.34:8.5","saṅgātigā tepi bhavantī",13,10]],"before":[{"para":315,"vripara":null,"title":"Nasantisuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Nasantisuttavaṇṇanā 34."]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":416,"to":420,"paras":[{"para":416,"vripara":"34","refs":["sn1.34:2"],"lines":["<b>Kamanīyānī</b>ti kantāni.","Tato eva etāni <b>iṭṭhārammaṇāni</b> sukhārammaṇāni <b>rūpādīni,</b> te pana vatthukāmā, tadārammaṇakilesakāmā vā.","<b>“Na santi kāmā manujesū”</b>ti desanāsīsametaṃ, nicchayena kāmā aniccāyeva.","Maccu dhīyati etthāti <b>maccudheyyaṃ</b>.","Na puna āgacchati ettha taṃ <b>apunāgamanaṃ.</b>","<b>Apunāgamanasaṅkhātaṃ nibbānaṃ</b> anupagacchanato.","<b>Nibbānaṃ hī</b>tiādi vuttassevatthassa vivaraṇaṃ.","<b>Baddho</b>ti paṭibaddhacitto.","<b>Pamatto</b>ti vossaggapamādaṃ āpanno."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:2"]]},{"para":417,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:2","sn1.34:3"],"lines":["<b>Taṇhāchandato</b> <b>jātaṃ</b> tassa visesapaccayattā.","Icchitaṃ hanatīti <b>aghaṃ,</b> dukkhaṃ.","Idha pana anavasesapariyādānavasena pañcupādānakkhandhā dukkhanti.","<b>Chandavinayā aghavinayo</b>ti hetunirodhena hi phalanirodho, evaṃ saupādisesanibbānaṃ vatvā <b>aghavinayā dukkhavinayo</b>ti anupādisesanibbānaṃ vadati."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:2"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:3"],["sn1.34:3"]]},{"para":418,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4"],"lines":["<b>Citrānī</b>ti kilesakāmāpi vedanādiṭṭhisampayogabhedena honti, ākārabhedena ca atthi savighātāvighātāti tato visesetuṃ <b>“ārammaṇacittānī”</b>ti vuttaṃ.","<b>Saṅkappitarāgo</b>ti subhādivasena saṅkappitavatthumhi rāgo.","<b>Kilesakāmo kāmoti vutto</b> tassevidha visesato kāmabhāvasiddhito.","<b>Pasūrasuttena vibhāvetabbo</b> “na te kāmā”tiādinā tassa vatthumhi āgatattā.","Idāni tamatthaṃ saṅkhepeneva vibhāvento <b>“pasūraparibbājako hī”</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Na te kāmā yāni citrāni loke</b>ti te ce kāmā na honti, yāni loke citrāni rūpādiārammaṇāni.","<b>Vedesī</b>ti kevalaṃ saṅkapparāgañca kāmaṃ katvā vadesi ce.","<b>Hehintī</b>ti bhaveyyunti attho.","Suṇanto saddāni manoramāni, satthāpi te hehiti kāmabhogīti paccekaṃ gāthā, idha pana saṃkhipitvā dassitā.","Dhīrā nāma dhitisampannāti āha <b>“paṇḍitā”</b>ti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"]]},{"para":419,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:4","sn1.34:7"],"lines":["<b>Tassā</b>ti yo pahīnakodhamāno sabbaso saṃyojanātigo nāmarūpasmiṃ asajjanto rāgādikiñcanarahito, tassa.","<b>Mogharājā nāma thero</b> bāvarībrāhmaṇassa paricārakānaṃ soḷasannaṃ aññataro.","<b>Yathānusandhiṃ</b> appatto sāvasesa-<b>attho,</b> kiñci vattabbaṃ atthīti adhippāyo.","Sabbaso vimuttattāva devamanussā namassanti, ye taṃ paṭipajjanti.","Tesaṃ kiṃ hoti?","Kiñcipi na siyāti ayamettha atthaviseso?","<b>Dasabalaṃ sandhāyevamāha</b> ukkaṭṭhaniddesena.","<b>Anupaṭipattiyāti</b> paṭipattiṃ anugantvā paṭipajjanena.","<b>Namassanti</b> taṃ pūjenti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:4"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:7"]]},{"para":420,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.34:7","sn1.34:8"],"lines":["<b>Catusaccadhammaṃ jānitvā</b>ti tena paṭividdhaṃ catusaccadhammaṃ paṭivijjhitvā.","Tathā ca buddhasubuddhatāya nibbematikā hontīti āha <b>“vicikicchaṃ pahāyā”</b>ti.","Tato paraṃ pana anukkamena aggamaggādhigamena <b>saṅgātigāpi</b> honti.","Asekkhadhammapāripūriyā <b>pasaṃsiyā</b> viññūnaṃ pasaṃsāpi hontīti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.34:7"],["sn1.34:8"],["sn1.34:8"],["sn1.34:8"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.34:2.2","kamanīyānī",0,0],["sn1.34:2.1","na santi kāmā manujesū",0,2],["sn1.34:2.3","apunāgamanaṃ",0,4],["sn1.34:2.2","baddho",0,7],["sn1.34:2.3","pamatto",0,8],["sn1.34:3.1","aghaṃ",1,1],["sn1.34:3.2","aghaṃ",1,1],["sn1.34:3.3","aghaṃ",1,1],["sn1.34:3.2","chandavinayā aghavinayo",1,3],["sn1.34:3.3","aghavinayā dukkhavinayo",1,3],["sn1.34:4.1","citrānī",2,0],["sn1.34:4.3","citrānī",2,0],["sn1.34:4.1","na te kāmā yāni citrāni loke",2,5],["sn1.34:7.4","attho",3,2],["sn1.34:7.5","namassanti",3,8],["sn1.34:8.4","vicikicchaṃ pahāyā",4,1],["sn1.34:8.1","pasaṃsiyā",4,3]],"before":[{"para":415,"vripara":null,"title":"Nasantisuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Nasantisuttavaṇṇanā 34."]}],"after":[{"para":421,"vripara":null,"title":"Nasantisuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Nasantisuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 5."]}]},"tika2":null}
